# Auto detect text files, store them with LF and check them out with LF on every OS (npm, Node and the tools write LF; core.autocrlf would turn them into CRLF and show unchanged files as modified)
* text=auto eol=lf
# Videos are binary: never converted, diffed nor merged ("!text" alone would leave them to eol=lf as text)
*.mp4 binary !filter
*.ps1 text eol=lf
